          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Poki repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没有默认中转。请用 Poki 仓库中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中转部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 账户，再输入它输出的地址。截图和轻点只经过这个中转。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 沒有預設中轉。請用 Poki 倉庫中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中轉部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 賬戶，再輸入它輸出的地址。截圖和輕點只經過這個中轉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is offline. Check that the phone has internet. Poki reconnects by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已离线。请检查此 iPhone 的网络连接，Poki 会自动重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已離線。請檢查此 iPhone 的網路連線，Poki 會自動重新連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki keeps the key now. Chatting with %@ comes in an update. Until then, choose Anthropic or OpenAI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
