          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts it again on the next agent request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体下次发出请求时，Poki 会重新启动它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 代理下次發出請求時，Poki 會重新啟動它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki stops opening after %@. Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 之后 Poki 将无法打开。请把这台 iPhone 连上 Mac，让 agent 为它续签。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 之後 Poki 將無法開啟。請把這臺 iPhone 連上 Mac，讓 agent 為它續簽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types through its own keyboard and never touches the clipboard. When the keyboard can’t be used, plain text is typed with key presses, and other text is not entered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过自己的键盘输入，绝不使用剪贴板。键盘无法使用时，普通文字用按键输入，其他文字不会输入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 透過自己的鍵盤輸入，絕不使用剪貼簿。鍵盤無法使用時，普通文字用按鍵輸入，其他文字不會輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types through its own keyboard panel, at a person’s pace. The panel has no keys. It shows while Poki types, and Take Over stops it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过自己的键盘面板以常人的速度输入。面板没有按键。Poki 输入时显示，轻点“接管”即可停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 透過自己的鍵盤面板以常人的速度輸入。面板沒有按鍵。Poki 輸入時顯示，輕點「接管」即可停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki types with key presses and pastes what the keys can’t type, such as Chinese and emoji. Your clipboard is put back afterwards. The Poki keyboard is not used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 用按键输入，按键无法输入的内容（如中文和表情符号）通过粘贴输入，之后会恢复你的剪贴板。不使用 Poki 键盘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 用按鍵輸入，按鍵無法輸入的內容（如中文和表情符號）透過貼上輸入，之後會恢復你的剪貼簿。不使用 Poki 鍵盤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki uses your ChatGPT plan, the way Codex does. The sign-in stays in this iPhone’s Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 与 Codex 一样，共享你的 ChatGPT 订阅额度。登录信息仅保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 與 Codex 一樣，共享你的 ChatGPT 訂閱額度。登入資訊僅儲存在此 iPhone 的鑰匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki opens the main Settings page. Go to **Privacy & Security › Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Poki**." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
