    },
    "A star helps other people find Poki. Thank you for being part of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一颗星标能帮助更多人发现 Poki。感谢你的参与。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一顆星標能幫助更多人發現 Poki。感謝你的參與。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow %@ to connect?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 %@ 连接吗？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允許 %@ 連線嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A client Poki doesn’t know (%@) is signing in with %@. Open Poki to allow or deny it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个 Poki 不认识的客户端（%@）正在通过 %@ 登录。请打开 Poki 允许或拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個 Poki 不認識的客戶端（%@）正在透過 %@ 登入。請開啟 Poki 允許或拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type it on the Pair with Poki screen in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置”的“与 Poki 配对”屏幕上输入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「設定」的「與 Poki 配對」螢幕上輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Karing's settings, then TUN." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Karing 的设置，然后进入 TUN。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟 Karing 的設定，然後進入 TUN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Loopback address (loopback_address) to 10.7.0.1, then reconnect Karing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将回环地址（loopback_address）设为 10.7.0.1，然后重新连接 Karing。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將回環地址（loopback_address）設為 10.7.0.1，然後重新連線 Karing。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Karing connected. Choose External app in Poki and do not enable Poki's built-in connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 Karing 连接。在 Poki 中选择外部 App，不要启用 Poki 的内置连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 Karing 連線。在 Poki 中選擇外部 App，不要啟用 Poki 的內建連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update Shadowrocket from the App Store. The switch came with version 2.2.91, and 2.2.93 and later are reported to work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从 App Store 更新 Shadowrocket。该开关自 2.2.91 版加入，据反馈 2.2.93 及更高版本可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從 App Store 更新 Shadowrocket。該開關自 2.2.91 版加入，據反饋 2.2.93 及更高版本可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shadowrocket, open **Settings › Other** and turn on **Include Route 10.7.0.1/32**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Shadowrocket 中打开**设置 › 其他**，开启**包含路由 10.7.0.1/32**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Shadowrocket 中開啟**設定 › 其他**，開啟**包含路由 10.7.0.1/32**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect Shadowrocket and connect it again on Wi-Fi. The switch only takes effect on a new connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Wi-Fi 下断开 Shadowrocket 再重新连接。该开关只在新建立的连接上生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Wi-Fi 下斷開 Shadowrocket 再重新連線。該開關只在新建立的連線上生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back to Poki and keep Shadowrocket connected. The status below turns to Loopback Is On by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回到 Poki，并保持 Shadowrocket 连接。下方状态会自行变为“回环已开启”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回到 Poki，並保持 Shadowrocket 連線。下方狀態會自行變為「迴環已開啟」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Reconnect after every change.** Turn Shadowrocket off and on again. A connection made before the switch was turned on does not carry the route." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**每次更改后都要重新连接。**关闭 Shadowrocket 再打开。在开启该开关之前建立的连接不带这条路由。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**每次更改後都要重新連線。**關閉 Shadowrocket 再開啟。在開啟該開關之前建立的連線不帶這條路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Start on Wi-Fi.** iOS refuses this loopback when the iPhone has only cellular. Once Poki is on, you can go back to cellular." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**在 Wi-Fi 下启动。**iPhone 只有蜂窝网络时，iOS 会拒绝此回环。Poki 开启后即可切回蜂窝网络。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**在 Wi-Fi 下啟動。**iPhone 只有蜂窩網路時，iOS 會拒絕此迴環。Poki 開啟後即可切回蜂窩網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Only one VPN at a time.** Turn off LocalDevVPN, StosVPN and Poki’s built-in connection. iOS runs one and the last one started wins." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**同一时间只能有一个 VPN。**关闭 LocalDevVPN、StosVPN 和 Poki 的内置连接。iOS 只运行一个，最后启动的那个生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**同一時間只能有一個 VPN。**關閉 LocalDevVPN、StosVPN 和 Poki 的內建連線。iOS 只執行一個，最後啟動的那個生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Leave Include All Networks and Force Routing off** in Shadowrocket’s settings while you test." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试期间，请在 Shadowrocket 的设置中**保持“包含所有网络”和“强制路由”关闭**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測試期間，請在 Shadowrocket 的設定中**保持「包含所有網路」和「強制路由」關閉**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Check your configuration’s excluded routes.** Many configurations keep 10.0.0.0/8 out of the tunnel (tun-excluded-routes). Edit the configuration, remove 10.0.0.0/8 from that line or try the default configuration, then reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**检查配置中的排除路由。**许多配置会把 10.0.0.0/8 排除在隧道之外（tun-excluded-routes）。编辑配置，从该行移除 10.0.0.0/8，或改用默认配置，然后重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**檢查配置中的排除路由。**許多配置會把 10.0.0.0/8 排除在隧道之外（tun-excluded-routes）。編輯配置，從該行移除 10.0.0.0/8，或改用預設配置，然後重新連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**The switch must be the one in the app.** A module or a [General] line does not turn the route on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**必须使用 App 内的开关。**模块或 [General] 中的配置行无法开启这条路由。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**必須使用 App 內的開關。**模組或 [General] 中的配置行無法開啟這條路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Pair again if the status says Loopback Is On but Poki cannot connect.** The route works then, and the pairing is what the phone refuses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**如果状态显示“回环已开启”但 Poki 仍无法连接，请重新配对。**此时路由正常，被手机拒绝的是配对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**如果狀態顯示「迴環已開啟」但 Poki 仍無法連線，請重新配對。**此時路由正常，被手機拒絕的是配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Still Not On Yet on iOS 18?** Some iPhones on iOS 18.7 never get the route from Shadowrocket. Use LocalDevVPN there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**iOS 18 上仍显示“尚未开启”？**部分运行 iOS 18.7 的 iPhone 始终无法从 Shadowrocket 获得这条路由，请改用 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**iOS 18 上仍顯示「尚未開啟」？**部分執行 iOS 18.7 的 iPhone 始終無法從 Shadowrocket 獲得這條路由，請改用 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Stash. If its TUN or override settings have a loopback or 10.7.0.1 option, turn it on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Stash。如果其 TUN 或覆写设置中有回环或 10.7.0.1 选项，请开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟 Stash。如果其 TUN 或覆寫設定中有迴環或 10.7.0.1 選項，請開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Otherwise add the lines below to an override (Settings › Overrides) and enable it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "否则请将下方几行添加到一个覆写（设置 › 覆写）并启用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "否則請將下方几行新增到一個覆寫（設定 › 覆寫）並啟用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconnect Stash and keep it connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新连接 Stash 并保持连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新連線 Stash 並保持連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the [general] section of your Quantumult X profile and save." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将其添加到 Quantumult X 配置的 [general] 部分并存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將其新增到 Quantumult X 配置的 [general] 部分並儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconnect Quantumult X and keep it connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新连接 Quantumult X 并保持连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新連線 Quantumult X 並保持連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the lines below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拷贝下方几行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複製下方几行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add them to the tun section of your Clash Mi profile, import it, then connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将其添加到 Clash Mi 配置的 tun 部分，导入后连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將其新增到 Clash Mi 配置的 tun 部分，匯入後連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Clash Mi connected. Users report this works on iOS 26.3 and failed on 26.4. The check above tells." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 Clash Mi 连接。据用户反馈，此方法在 iOS 26.3 上可用，在 26.4 上失败。以上方的检查结果为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 Clash Mi 連線。據使用者反饋，此方法在 iOS 26.3 上可用，在 26.4 上失敗。以上方的檢查結果為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To download updates by itself, Poki needs your Apple Account. Sign in under Signing Options. Or update Poki from Poki Setup on your Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要让 Poki 自行下载更新，需要你的 Apple 账户。请在“签名选项”中登录。也可以通过 Mac 上的 Poki Setup 更新 Poki。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要讓 Poki 自行下載更新，需要你的 Apple 賬戶。請在「簽名選項」中登入。也可以透過 Mac 上的 Poki Setup 更新 Poki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't reach this iPhone. Turn on the loopback, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
