    "Create a key at console.anthropic.com, then paste it here. On a Claude Max or Team plan, first claim your plan’s monthly API credits in claude.ai › Settings › Billing, so the key uses them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 console.anthropic.com 创建密钥，然后粘贴到此处。如果使用 Claude Max 或 Team 套餐，请先在 claude.ai › Settings › Billing 中领取套餐每月的 API 额度，密钥才会使用这些额度。"
