    },
    "An agent saves a routine after a task that worked. The next time it repeats the task in one step and stops where the screen differs. Swipe a routine to forget it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务成功后，智能体会保存一个例程。下次它会一步重复该任务，并在屏幕不同之处停下。轻扫例程即可忘记它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任務成功後，AI 代理會儲存一個例程。下次它會一步重複該任務，並在螢幕不同之處停下。輕掃例程即可忘記它。"
          }
