    "One file with every routine and note. Importing merges it in, and the newer copy of a routine wins. Poki Setup on your computer can back it up and put it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个包含所有例程和备忘的文件。导入时会合并，同一例程以较新的为准。电脑上的 Poki Setup 可以备份和恢复它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個包含所有例程和備忘的檔案。匯入時會合並，同一例程以較新的為準。電腦上的 Poki Setup 可以備份和恢復它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear Memory" : {
