    },
    "10.7.0.1 takes the connection, but the pairing service behind it did not answer (%@). Reconnect your proxy app or LocalDevVPN and check Wi-Fi, then tap Check Again. The pairing itself is kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10.7.0.1 接受了连接，但其后的配对服务没有响应（%@）。请重新连接你的代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 并检查 Wi-Fi，然后轻点“再次检查”。配对本身会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10.7.0.1 接受了連線，但其後的配對服務沒有響應（%@）。請重新連線你的代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 並檢查 Wi-Fi，然後輕點「再次檢查」。配對本身會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing on the phone itself needs iOS 27, and this iPhone runs iOS %@. Pair it from a computer instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在手机上直接配对需要 iOS 27，此 iPhone 运行的是 iOS %@。请改为通过电脑配对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在手機上直接配對需要 iOS 27，此 iPhone 執行的是 iOS %@。請改為透過電腦配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Poki Setup** on your Mac or PC, connect this iPhone by cable, and tap **Pair**. Tap **Trust** on the iPhone when asked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 或 PC 上打开 **Poki Setup**，用线缆连接此 iPhone，然后轻点**配对**。iPhone 询问时请轻点**信任**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 或 PC 上開啟 **Poki Setup**，用線纜連線此 iPhone，然後輕點**配對**。iPhone 詢問時請輕點**信任**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send the pairing file here. Tap **Scan Pairing Code** below (or scan Poki Setup's code with the Camera), AirDrop the file to this iPhone and open it with Poki, or tap **Import Pairing File** below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将配对文件发送到这里。轻点下方的**扫描配对码**（或用“相机”扫描 Poki Setup 的二维码），通过隔空投送将文件发送到此 iPhone 并用 Poki 打开，或轻点下方的**导入配对文件**。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將配對檔案傳送到這裡。輕點下方的**掃描配對碼**（或用「相機」掃描 Poki Setup 的二維碼），透過隔空投送將檔案傳送到此 iPhone 並用 Poki 開啟，或輕點下方的**匯入配對檔案**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
