    "Poki cannot start the usual way because the local connection is off. Turn the loopback on in your proxy app, or start anyway with iOS’s automation banner showing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机连接已关闭，Poki 无法以常用方式启动。请在代理 App 中打开回环，或者在显示 iOS 自动化横幅的情况下直接开始。"
          }
        },
