    "Opens Setup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开配置"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set your relay first. Each agent gets its own MCP address on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先设置中转。每个智能体在中转上都有自己的 MCP 地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先設定中轉。每個AI 代理在中轉上都有自己的 MCP 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each agent gets its own MCP address. Add it as a remote MCP server in Claude, Codex or any MCP client. It takes the agent’s name and icon when the agent first connects, unless you renamed it. Swipe to revoke." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个智能体都有自己的 MCP 地址。在 Claude、Codex 或任何 MCP 客户端中将它添加为远程 MCP 服务器。智能体首次连接时会带上它的名称和图标，除非你已重新命名。轻扫即可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個AI 代理都有自己的 MCP 地址。在 Claude、Codex 或任何 MCP 客戶端中將它新增為遠端 MCP 伺服器。AI 代理首次連線時會帶上它的名稱和圖示，除非你已重新命名。輕掃即可撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone stays where the task ended. Poki’s reply comes as a notification. Touch and hold it to answer and carry on from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机停留在任务结束的地方。Poki 的回复会以通知送达。按住通知即可回答并从那里继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手機停留在任務結束的地方。Poki 的回覆會以通知送達。按住通知即可回答並從那裡繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki keeps the password in this iPhone’s Keychain to sign itself again every week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 将密码保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中，以便每周为自己重新签名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 將密碼儲存在此 iPhone 的鑰匙串中，以便每週為自己重新簽名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki signs in again when its signing is due, and asks you for the password then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "签名到期时 Poki 会重新登录，届时会向你询问密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "簽名到期時 Poki 會重新登入，屆時會向你詢問密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share Run Log for Maintainers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与维护者共享运行日志"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "與維護者共享執行日誌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional, for live voice without an OpenAI key on this iPhone. Run bin/voice-bridge.mjs on your Mac and enter the address it gives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可选，用于在此 iPhone 没有 OpenAI 密钥时使用实时语音。在 Mac 上运行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs，然后输入它给出的地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可選，用於在此 iPhone 沒有 OpenAI 金鑰時使用實時語音。在 Mac 上執行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs，然後輸入它給出的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No extra app needed. Poki connects only to this iPhone. Your normal traffic and DNS stay on their usual routes. iOS shows it as a VPN, so it may disconnect another VPN app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无需额外 App。Poki 只连接此 iPhone。你平常的流量和 DNS 仍走原来的路线。iOS 会将它显示为 VPN，因此可能会断开其他 VPN App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無需額外 App。Poki 只連線此 iPhone。你平常的流量和 DNS 仍走原來的路線。iOS 會將它顯示為 VPN，因此可能會斷開其他 VPN App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again from Poki Setup on your computer and send the new file here. The old key is replaced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复 iPhone、还原“位置与隐私”或 iPhone 忘记 Poki 后会出现这种情况。请在电脑上的 Poki Setup 中重新配对，并将新文件发送到这里。旧密钥会被替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢復 iPhone、還原「位置與隱私」或 iPhone 忘記 Poki 後會出現這種情況。請在電腦上的 Poki Setup 中重新配對，並將新檔案傳送到這裡。舊金鑰會被替換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki stays active in the background without the location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在后台保持活跃且不显示定位指示，绝不记录你的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 在後臺保持活躍且不顯示定位指示，絕不記錄你的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location Services is off for Poki. It keeps itself running with silent audio, which iOS may stop during calls or other audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 的定位服务已关闭。它改用静音音频保持运行，通话或播放其他音频时 iOS 可能会停止它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 的定位服務已關閉。它改用靜音音訊保持執行，通話或播放其他音訊時 iOS 可能會停止它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS needs a background mode to keep apps running. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location with Always Allow, which shows no location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 需要后台模式才能让 App 保持运行。Poki 使用最低精度的定位并设为“始终允许”，这样不会显示定位指示，也绝不记录你的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 需要後臺模式才能讓 App 保持執行。Poki 使用最低精度的定位並設為「始終允許」，這樣不會顯示定位指示，也絕不記錄你的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Background App Refresh on for Poki. With it off, iOS stops Poki soon after it leaves the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请为 Poki 保持开启后台 App 刷新。关闭后，Poki 离开屏幕不久就会被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請為 Poki 保持開啟後臺 App 重新整理。關閉後，Poki 離開螢幕不久就會被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background App Refresh is restricted on this iPhone (Low Power Mode, Screen Time or a profile turns it off), so iOS may stop Poki in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 iPhone 上的后台 App 刷新受到限制（低电量模式、屏幕使用时间或描述文件将其关闭），因此 iOS 可能会在后台停止 Poki。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 iPhone 上的後臺 App 重新整理受到限制（低電量模式、螢幕使用時間或描述檔案將其關閉），因此 iOS 可能會在後臺停止 Poki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Background App Refresh** on Poki’s page in Settings, and under Settings › General › Background App Refresh. With it off, iOS stops Poki soon after it leaves the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置”中 Poki 的页面以及“设置 › 通用 › 后台 App 刷新”中开启**后台 App 刷新**。关闭后，Poki 离开屏幕不久就会被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「設定」中 Poki 的頁面以及「設定 › 通用 › 後臺 App 重新整理」中開啟**後臺 App 重新整理**。關閉後，Poki 離開螢幕不久就會被 iOS 停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes and approvals on the Lock Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在锁定屏幕上显示步骤、配对码和批准请求。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會在鎖定螢幕上顯示步驟、配對碼和批准請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn them on to see the agent’s steps and approve sensitive actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后即可查看智能体的步骤并批准敏感操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後即可檢視AI 代理的步驟並批准敏感操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Poki needs is in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 所需的一切都已就绪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 所需的一切都已就緒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs every item ticked before an agent or the chat can use this iPhone. Items tick themselves when the phone can check them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有项目都打勾后，智能体或聊天才能使用此 iPhone。手机能检查的项目会自动打勾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有專案都打勾後，AI 代理或聊天才能使用此 iPhone。手機能檢查的專案會自動打勾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while Poki’s automation session is open. Poki opens it when an agent asks and closes it when idle. Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在 Poki 的自动化会话打开时，iOS 才会显示自动化横幅。智能体提出请求时 Poki 打开会话，空闲时关闭。“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的例程和备忘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在 Poki 的自動化會話開啟時，iOS 才會顯示自動化橫幅。AI 代理提出請求時 Poki 開啟會話，空閒時關閉。「記憶」儲存所有AI 代理共享的例程和備忘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的例程和备忘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「記憶」儲存所有AI 代理共享的例程和備忘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your turn, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轮到你了，%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "輪到你了，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A local connection change is already in progress. Try again when it finishes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机连接正在更改中。请在完成后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本機連線正在更改中。請在完成後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not start Poki's local VPN. Allow the VPN configuration when asked. If signing does not include Network Extensions, use the external-connection build with LocalDevVPN or a compatible proxy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动 Poki 的本机 VPN。系统询问时请允许 VPN 配置。如果签名不包含网络扩展，请使用外部连接版，并搭配 LocalDevVPN 或兼容的代理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法啟動 Poki 的本機 VPN。系統詢問時請允許 VPN 配置。如果簽名不包含網路擴充套件，請使用外部連線版，並搭配 LocalDevVPN 或相容的代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local VPN disconnected. Reconnect here. If it keeps stopping, check that both Poki and its tunnel were signed with Network Extensions, or choose an external connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机 VPN 已断开。请在这里重新连接。如果它不断停止，请检查 Poki 及其隧道是否都以网络扩展签名，或选择外部连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本機 VPN 已斷開。請在這裡重新連線。如果它不斷停止，請檢查 Poki 及其隧道是否都以網路擴充套件簽名，或選擇外部連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another VPN appears to be on, so Poki did not turn its local connection back on. Turn that VPN off and tap Enable Local Connection, or choose an external connection in Setup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "似乎有其他 VPN 已开启，所以 Poki 没有重新开启本机连接。请关闭该 VPN 并轻点“启用本机连接”，或在配置中选择外部连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "似乎有其他 VPN 已開啟，所以 Poki 沒有重新開啟本機連線。請關閉該 VPN 並輕點「啟用本機連線」，或在配置中選擇外部連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signing in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在登录"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在登入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在检查验证码"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在檢查驗證碼"
          }
        }
